WEBVTT

00:00:28.524 --> 00:00:30.943
is if they leave a room
filled with more hope

00:00:30.985 --> 00:00:32.570
than when they first arrived.”

00:00:33.321 --> 00:00:36.908
I'm here with you tonight
to attempt to fulfill that aspiration.

00:00:37.241 --> 00:00:38.910
To leave you with hope.

00:00:39.660 --> 00:00:41.537
We need it now more than ever.

00:00:41.537 --> 00:00:44.290
Our home, our shared beautiful mother,

00:00:44.332 --> 00:00:47.668
our planet is experiencing
ecological turmoil.

00:00:47.710 --> 00:00:50.546
We humans are transforming it to a point

00:00:50.546 --> 00:00:54.884
where we are risking the survival
of millions of species.

00:00:54.884 --> 00:00:59.388
And as a result, our societies
are also experiencing a parallel turmoil

00:00:59.388 --> 00:01:02.100
as we struggle to adapt
to the unnatural pace